Poly-X — third-party notices
============================

This distribution contains a Python derivative of part of pycocotools
(https://github.com/cocodataset/cocoapi), the polygon rasterizer COCO's own
evaluation uses. The port lives in ``src/polyx/pipeline/evaluation.py``
(``rasterize_segmentation`` / ``_polygon_to_mask``) and is redistributed under
